{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_akafyu_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_akafyu_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"異鄉劍士","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_akafyu_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e8985c1bddfe10d524cfe828109a640f5cf1a85a9b1594021d1c1ff32a63a235","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"大人，這次作戰失利責任全在我指揮失當，未能識破敵人奸計，所有罪責由屬下一人承擔！\n屬下深知自己罪不容誅，我一人死不足惜，但屬下只求一個最後報答大人的機會，我定能——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大人！我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九百九十八......九百九十九......一千......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍士收起長劍，深深吐納。抽出隨身小刀在牆上的計數符號上又刻下一劃。\n被驅逐出東國的第一百三十七天，停留在這座名為龍門的陌生城市的第三十九天。\n離開東國之前，收到了一家名為“羅德島”的公司的邀請，他們說自己依然有可以作為劍士而戰的機會——大抵也是主上的默許。\n如今自己要做的就是在這裡耐心等待，等待對方接頭人帶自己去新的安身地點——某個遠離東國的地方。\n前路未卜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鍛煉從未懈怠，可刀油已經用完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何是好......"},{"type":"narration","text":"人們常說，落單的劍士脆弱如羽獸。曾經握在手中的劍越是鋒銳，便越是易折。\n離開東國前遇到過數次幾乎致命的麻煩，之後的路雖相對安穩，可也不清楚是否還有敵人跟隨自己來到此處，萬萬不能掉以輕心。\n按照約定，每十天會有人按時將必需的生活物資留在門口，自己不該隨意離開這間屋子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天似乎也沒有異樣......"},{"type":"narration","text":"暫住的居所地處城市週邊的一條老舊小巷中，絲毫不引人注目，應該還算安全。\n偶有形形色色的路人路過，還有每日都會按時擺攤的早餐店主，沒有發現可疑的人。\n從窗戶可以看到這座陌生城市一隅。龍門的模樣和家鄉大不相同，與傳聞中南朝治下的光怪陸離的城市倒有幾分相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食物都已經消耗盡了，今天本該是補充物資的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知周圍是否還有追兵潛藏，貿然出行恐怕還是有危險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......何等令人煩躁，堂堂劍士豈有避戰畏敵的道理！光嚴家的劍士何曾有過這般屈辱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"適應環境，是必要的修行......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按時進食也是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"narration","text":"深巷。\n劍士謹慎地踏出一步，月餘來第一次走出房間，第一次從低處觀察這片空間。\n小巷兩側低矮的房屋緊緊擠挨著，露出狹窄的一方天空，劍士恍惚想起神社低矮的屋簷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看上去是老舊的民居，並無特殊之處。建築上懸掛的雜物眾多，也無合適的狙擊位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進出都只有一個口，就算有跟蹤者，應該很難隱藏蹤跡。可若遇到伏兵堵截，敵眾我寡時，脫身同樣麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此地不宜久——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隊長！小心弩炮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經中了埋伏，敵人數量太多，繼續苦戰也是不會有結果的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"振作起來，我們一起殺出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請您先撤退吧！我們會為您斷後的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"再睜開眼，身旁空無一人。\n陽光燦爛，和那個雪天所見的陽光別無二致，湧入鼻腔的卻是臨街店鋪傳來的油煙味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的食客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，今天怎麼大清早就開始做炒菜啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早餐店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾試試換個花樣，最近年輕人起床越來越晚，早午飯都合一頓了，我也得跟著適應不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜些......不能因為過去的失敗失態......冷靜些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早餐店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"那位姑娘，還沒吃飯吧，吃點什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早餐店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"再怎麼匆忙，還是要好好吃飯啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（常見的街邊飯店。店主人和客人都是普通人，感受不到危險的氣息。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（或許可以用這裡的食物充饑。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，都提供什麼食物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早餐店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"豆漿油條，包子炒麵，什麼都有。這裡的客人都說我們家的腸粉是一絕，您要不要嚐嚐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（面皮包裹著看不清的餡料，還有來路不明的醬汁，這香味的確是容易讓人精神動搖......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不......不妥，還是得尋找更為安全的食物才行。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的食客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那個人怎麼回事，看上去像是沒有帶錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早餐店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"有些面生，好像不是住這附近的人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早餐店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"那姑娘看上去面黃肌瘦的，怕是有陣子都沒好好吃飯了。唉，要是口袋裡緊張的話，請她一頓也不要緊的呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"narration","text":"碼頭。\n城市的重要出入口，人流量最為龐大的地方之一。如果與自己接頭的人來自更遠的地方，他有可能會出現在這裡。\n劍士站在高處凝神眺望，稍遠處，大型艦船吞吐著數量龐大的貨物和人群，稍作停頓又匆忙駛向遠方。\n其中是不是也有一條船，可以直接駛向東國......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......還遠不是回去的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以敗軍之將的身份被驅逐，之後便再無作為，就算回到故土，又有何面目去見大人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆......打擾一下......您踩到我的貨箱了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，要買鱗嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新鮮的鱗，種類挺全的，都是今天剛送來的。可以幫您切好，也可以現做成刺身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（刺身......熟悉的食物。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒有多餘的烹飪手法，不用加多餘的調味料，是安全的食物。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要。一條鱗，做成刺身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，一份刺身，您稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個小販，竟然有如此身手？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（將一把普通的剔骨刀運用得如此精妙。手臂肌肉發力的方式，刀鋒入肉的角度，皆合乎劍理。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此精湛的刀法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刀法是何人所授，流派可有名號，這把刀可有來歷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆......您問我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫孑，是個水產販子，用刀的本事是我阿伯教給我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這把刀就是用來切鱗的，沒切過別的東西。您問流派......處理殼蝦和鱗確實是要用不同的刀具和手法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是閉關修煉的流派，定力可敬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在神社裡也見過十年如一日只劈砍草席修煉的劍客。將一個普通的招式修煉到出神入化，同樣有驚人威力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有這樣的身手，卻淪落至鱗肆肉鋪之間......看來你也是不得志的劍士。在這一點上，我們也算是同病相憐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我且問你，將來可有什麼志向？準備用這身武藝為誰效力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我沒什麼大志向......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼前的理想就是生意能好一點，多存一點錢，儘早換一家更大的鋪面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼話，這樣的刀法只用來砍切這些小玩意，你就不覺得可惜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小玩意？老闆是嫌這條鱗小嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......大一點的鱗當然也有，都是按斤數賣，不貪您便宜。我就是怕您吃不完......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（話裡有話，反而借飯量拷問我嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開什麼玩笑，“有多大的飯量就有多大能耐”，區區一條鱗，哪有吃不完的道理！儘管挑你這最大的鱗端上來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來取預訂貨物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"草鱗，一條，殼蝦，三斤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水產小販","speakerId":"avg_272_strong_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，都備好了。給，您拿好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群中，一個熟悉的身影飄然掠過。腳步很輕，動作很快。就像偶然躍出水面的鱗，轉眼間又遁入江中，無跡可尋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的裝扮......南朝的忍者？為什麼會出現在這裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人！屬下護駕來遲，您還安好嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些忍者，三番五次意圖暗殺，實在卑鄙！他們自知無法在戰場上光明正大地戰勝您，就只會使這些下三濫的手段！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赤冬，你可知道，這些人為什麼想要殺我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，您是光嚴家的重臣，最驍勇的戰將。他們忌憚您，才會想對您不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，這是派他們前來殺我的人的理由，而並非是他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可悲的是，恐怕這些倒在地上的人，他們至死都不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赤冬，你不該和他們一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"長街。\n跋涉許久，時間已經入夜。\n街上張燈結彩，眼前盡是望不到頭的霓虹燈牌和高樓大廈，耳邊路人歡聲笑語不斷——今天難道是這異邦的某個節日嗎？\n人潮洶湧，劍士佇立其中，像是被浪潮反覆拍打的礁石。而追蹤的目標早已不見了身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早有預謀嗎？故意引我來這種地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬧市殺人，那些卑鄙忍者最慣用的伎倆......這裡是他們的主場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巷戰並非我所長，可若喪失戰意，只會讓他們更輕易得手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底在哪......！"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍士緊緊握住刀柄，屏氣凝神，想要從喧囂聲中分辨出那一絲危險的響動，可總是徒勞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"老兄！你這身裝備好酷！簡直和真的一樣！"},{"type":"narration","text":"赤冬回過頭，一個年輕人正觸摸著自己的肩甲，眼裡閃著興奮的光芒。\n劍士正要發作，可眼前的年輕人無知的神情讓她奇怪又陌生——哪有平民敢這樣堂而皇之地靠近全副武裝的武士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不怕我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"怕？為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"今天不是《南北風雲傳》發售預告的第一天嗎？你是怎麼提前弄到這身衣服的設計圖的？我懂了，你是官方請來做宣傳的模特兒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"這身鎧甲是北朝光嚴派的劍士對不對！聽說北朝劍士基礎屬性很強，南朝的忍者操作上限高。但我覺得還是劍士的裝備更帥一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在胡說些什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忍者？你剛才有見到一個忍者嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，看那邊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"赤冬順著年輕人手指的方向看去，炫彩的燈光讓赤冬眼花繚亂，她費了些功夫才將視線聚焦在路旁電玩店的大螢幕上。\n遊戲裡角色裝備著與自己幾乎一模一樣的鎧甲和長刀，使出自己萬萬做不到的招式動作，在數量誇張的敵軍中大殺四方。\n螢幕裡的人血肉橫飛，痛哭哀號；螢幕外的人興高采烈，大呼小叫。\n透亮的櫥窗照出自己的影子，像是個滑稽的異類。\n劍士突然笑出了聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在這個地方，你很幸運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你永遠都不用害怕這個東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是記著，這個東西，一點也不酷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"赤冬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個標誌......羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"來的路上不太順利，耽誤了一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉讓你久等了，這邊生活還算順心？沒有遇到麻煩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是個奇怪的地方，但也算有趣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你是烏薩斯人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，為了避免麻煩我還專門做了打扮來著......是口音暴露了嗎？好吧沒錯，我確實是烏薩斯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與東國有聯絡，又雇傭了烏薩斯人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“羅德島”，到底是什麼地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"是個和平的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡有烏薩斯人，也有東國人，還有卡西米爾人、萊塔尼亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不是說要讓所有人都假裝那些不愉快的事沒有發生一樣，只是在那裡，仇恨和暴力不會是我們辦事的邏輯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可有人告訴我，在羅德島，我還是可以作為劍士而戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。羅德島還有很多和你一樣的優秀的戰士——我們確實是醫療公司，可為了救人，還是有需要打架的時候的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"但更多時候，大家還是做著普通的事，吃吃飯喝喝茶，然後想辦法避免出現必須要打架的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有意思。我願意去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你比我想像的要好打交道多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"還有沒有要收拾的行李，我們可以出發了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤冬","speakerId":"avg_475_akafyu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿著這把刀就夠了。走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
